        ]
      ],
      "text": "📌 30秒速记｜相关系数先看正负决定方向，再看绝对值离1多近。回归线只是在做估计，永远别把“相关”写成“因果”。",
      "sourceIndex": 4201
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固题｜需要时再做",
      "style": "Heading3",
      "sourceIndex": 4202
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. r=0.8方向。",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 4203
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. r=-0.2方向。",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 4204
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. |r|范围。",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 4205
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 回归直线必过哪个点？",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 4206
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 回归预测应写成确定事实吗？",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 4207
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1.正相关；2.负相关但较弱；3.0到1；4.(x̄,ȳ)；5.不能，应写预测/估计",
      "style": "TinyNote",
      "sourceIndex": 4208
    },
